Only attribution prompts/validation, adjacent context, and sequential identity reduction
are retained under src/preset35. Research runners, credentials, artifact exporters,
cost tables, original-file reparsing and frozen model execution are not included.
Imports use BOAA's shared source utilities. Model policy text is provider-neutral.
The service adapter accepts BOAA source coordinates and produces versioned checkpoints.
